  "info": {
    "contact": {},
    "description": "Server-to-server API for hotel availability, booking and cancellation, with signed webhooks.\n\n**Authentication.** Create an API key in the dashboard (Developers → API keys) and send it as `Authorization: Bearer tvk_...`.\nKeys are secrets: use them from your server only, never in browser or mobile code. A key belongs to one organization,\ncarries scopes (`properties:read`, `availability:read`, `reservations:read`, `reservations:write`) and may be restricted to specific properties.\n\n**Envelope.** Success: `{ \"success\": true, \"data\": ... }`. Failure: `{ \"success\": false, \"error\": { \"code\", \"message\", \"details\"? } }`.\nMoney is an integer in minor units (paise). Dates are `YYYY-MM-DD`; timestamps are ISO 8601 UTC.\n\n**Idempotency.** `POST /v1/reservations` requires an `Idempotency-Key` header. Retrying with the same key and body returns the original booking.\n\n**Rate limits.** Per key; every response carries `RateLimit-Limit`, `RateLimit-Remaining`, `RateLimit-Reset`; `429` adds `Retry-After`.\n\n**Versioning.** The version is in the path. Within v1 we only add fields, endpoints, enum values and event types; clients must ignore unknown fields.\nBreaking changes ship as /v2 with at least 12 months of notice before v1 is retired. Every response carries `X-Tirvona-Api-Version`.\n\n**Webhooks.** Register endpoints in the dashboard. Events (`reservation.created`, `reservation.confirmed`, `reservation.cancelled`, `payment.succeeded`, `payment.failed`) are POSTed as JSON with\n`Tirvona-Signature: t=<unix>,v1=<HMAC-SHA256(secret, \"<t>.<raw body>\")>`, `Tirvona-Event-Id` (deduplicate on it) and `Tirvona-Event-Type`.\nRespond 2xx within 10 s; other responses are retried with exponential backoff (12 attempts over about 17 hours). See docs/PUBLIC_API.md.",
    "title": "Tirvona Public API",
    "version": "v1"
  },
  "openapi": "3.0.0",
  "paths": {
    "/payments/verify": {
      "post": {
        "operationId": "PaymentsController_verify",
        "parameters": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/VerifyPaymentDto"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PaymentResponseDto"
                    },
                    "success": {
                      "example": true,
                      "type": "boolean"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "success",
                    "data"
                  ],
                  "type": "object"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Success"
          },
          "400": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorResponseDto"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "VALIDATION_ERROR: the request body, query or path is invalid"
          },
          "404": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorResponseDto"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "NOT_FOUND"
          },
          "429": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorResponseDto"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "RATE_LIMITED"
          }
        },
        "summary": "Verify the Razorpay Checkout signature and capture the payment (guest browser callback)",
        "tags": [
          "Payments"
        ]
      }
    },
